     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Folks,<div><br></div><div>For those that may be interested, this is a great set of workshops, taught by lots of friendly and helpful instructors. </div><div><br></div><div>If you are interested, see info below.</div><div><br></div><div>Adios,<br>Ryan</div><div><br></div><div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">---------- Forwarded message ----------<br>From: <b class=\"gmail_sendername\">C. Titus Brown</b> <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ctb...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;</span><br>Date: Wed, Feb 21, 2018 at 7:10 AM<br>Subject: [dib-training] Announcing the 2018 Data Intensive Biology Summer Institute (DIBSI)!<br>To: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">dib-tr...@lists.idyll.org</a><br>Cc: &quot;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">di...@lists.idyll.org</a>&quot; &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">di...@lists.idyll.org</a>&gt;<br><br><br>Please forward as appropriate!<br>\r\n<br>\r\n—<br>\r\n<br>\r\n# Announcing the 2018 Data Intensive Biology Summer Institute (DIBSI)!<br>\r\n<br>\r\nLink: <a href=\"http://ivory.idyll.org/dibsi/\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://ivory.idyll.org/dibsi/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466542884000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1C_5RWDzI-wBR0-4LyR2RD\">http://ivory.idyll.org/dibsi/</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\nWhere: Davis, California; in Valley Hall at UC Davis School of Veterinary Medicine<br>\r\nWhen: June 25 to July 14, 2018 (multiple events; see below)<br>\r\nWhat: Computational training for research-active biologists and bioinformaticians!<br>\r\nContact info: please send questions to [<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">dibsi.t...@gmail.com</a>](mailto:<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">dib...@gmail.com</a>).<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThis summer, the Lab for Data Intensive Biology will host a summer institute for biologists interested in learning or improving upon computational skills. This will include a two week no-skills-required workshop (July 2-July 14) during which biologists will learn cloud computing, UNIX command line skills, and high-throughput shotgun sequencing data analysis -- this workshop was successfully run for seven years at Michigan State University and moved to UC Davis last year.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nDIBSI is open to anyone and everyone.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThe activities at the DIBSI will include:<br>\r\n<br>\r\n* A two-day instructor training course for teachers and core facility personnel to become Carpentry instructors (June 25-26);<br>\r\n* Several Software and Data Carpentry 2-day workshops (June 27-28);<br>\r\n* A two-week introductory bioinformatics workshop ([see materials from 2017](<a href=\"https://angus.readthedocs.io/en/2017\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://angus.readthedocs.io/en/2017&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466542884000&amp;usg=AOvVaw32MVkVj4q70MZq2ClqKfVn\">https://angus.readthedocs.io/en/2017</a>)) (July 2-July 14)<br>\r\n<br>\r\nAll materials from the workshops will be freely and openly available for reuse after the Summer Institute.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nFor more information, please see the DIBSI 2018 Web site at <a href=\"http://ivory.idyll.org/dibsi/\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://ivory.idyll.org/dibsi/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466542884000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1C_5RWDzI-wBR0-4LyR2RD\">http://ivory.idyll.org/dibsi/</a>.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nApplications for ANGUS are open until Mar 5!: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeuXw5aX6NUGdzb4NnhQi3CLEMIxHr_vvVZFB762fCJkkkYGA/viewform\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeuXw5aX6NUGdzb4NnhQi3CLEMIxHr_vvVZFB762fCJkkkYGA/viewform&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466542884000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3nz7pRsg_ZyGFFOGuh1oUg\">https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeuXw5aX6NUGdzb4NnhQi3CLEMIxHr_vvVZFB762fCJkkkYGA/viewform</a> - after that, acceptance will be on a rolling basis given availability.<br>\r\n_______________________________________________<br>\r\ndib-training mailing list<br>\r\n<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">dib-tr...@lists.idyll.org</a><br>\r\n<a href=\"http://lists.idyll.org/listinfo/dib-training\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://lists.idyll.org/listinfo/dib-training&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466542884000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0euajGWEvBbLQz0f_j7lEQ\">http://lists.idyll.org/listinfo/dib-training</a><br>\r\n</div><br><br clear=\"all\"><div><br></div>-- <br><div class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br><span style=\"line-height:19px\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><i><b><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;display:inline!important;float:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span> </span></span><br style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"></b></i><